Third-party code
================

Muster contains no code copied from copyleft projects. Code ported from permissively
licensed projects is attributed in this file, with the project it comes from, its
licence and its copyright notice. Files copied into the repository unchanged keep their
own licence header and are listed below, so that the licence header check skips them.

Third-party files excluded from the licence header check:
  (none)

The list above is read by `make lint` (internal/tools/licensecheck). It runs from its
heading to the next blank line. Each entry is a line "  - <glob>  <origin and licence>":
<glob> is a path relative to the repository root, matched segment by segment with Go's
path.Match patterns, and a trailing "/**" matches every file below a directory; the text
after the glob is for readers. A single line "  (none)" stands for an empty list.


